00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:53.160
Taiwan reported that autonomous AI agents conducted cyber attacks against government systems.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:58.260
The incidents mark one of the first publicly acknowledged uses of fully agent-driven

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:04.360
offensive operations at nation-state scale. No specific agent frameworks or success rates were

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:10.140
disclosed. Security teams should treat this as a signal that long horizon agent reliability has

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:15.780
reached operational maturity in adversarial settings. Backtrader Bench introduces a

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:23.020
deterministic MCQ pipeline, and a generator solver filter to evaluate LLM agents on algorithmic

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:30.700
trading without data contamination. Tool augmented agents reached 90% accuracy in a single pass on a

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:37.900
30-question set. That result beats the best no tools baseline by 17 points. Quantitative finance

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:43.780
teams can use the open MCQ generator to create custom training corpora for trading agents.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:50.720
Trace Bench decomposes role profiles into checklists and uses a user agent to update states during

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:58.060
natural conversation. The benchmark achieved 99.91% coverage of role requirements in fewer turns

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:04.300
than free dialogue transcripts. It was run across 26 models and supports closed loop evolution

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:10.600
by distilling successful verification methods from failed traces. Roleplay and simulation developers

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:17.000
should adopt the checklist approach for reproducible agent evaluation. Speedrunner is a coding agent

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:23.120
that analyzes past trajectories, refactors them into reusable programs, and equips them for future

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:29.380
tasks without replay or validation. Across three embodied environments, it consistently reached the

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:34.940
frontier in both performance and cost reduction, while remaining robust to distribution shifts.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:40.560
Embodied agent teams should test programmatic refactoring on their existing trajectory logs.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.820
Simon Willison shared the exact prompt generate an SVG of a pelican riding a bicycle

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:53.400
as a reliable way to elicit clean SVG output from current models. The technique requires no

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:58.880
additional tooling or fine tuning. Front end and visualization developers can immediately use

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:05.120
this pattern to generate editable vector graphics instead of raster images. Shaper lets frozen

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.920
foundation models evolve reusable skills and context code harnesses through target environment

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:17.180
rollouts without parameter updates. It outperformed pure execution, supervised fine tuning,

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:24.860
and test time scaling baselines on VLA bench and ESI bench. Robotics and simulation teams should

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:29.360
examine the skill harness evolution loop on their own low-level action interfaces.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.940
Okay, let's pop the hood on recurrent depth retrofit. The retrofit splits a frozen base model

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:43.000
into a prelude, a weight-tied recurrent block, and a coda. It installs an identity preserving one loop

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:49.580
path plus a reentry bridge on later loops. At loop one, the modified model stays non-inferior

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:56.460
on an arc battery. With intermediate supervision, it computes one task step per loop and persists even

00:04:56.460 --> 00:05:02.480
when only final answers are graded. The adapter version with 6 million trained parameters matched the

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:09.900
full 180 million block up to depth 11. It extrapolated to roughly 1.5 times supervised depth

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:17.640
while retaining 70% accuracy at depth 18. A same size scratch pad model collapsed beyond its training

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:25.600
horizon. The recurrent version retained 53% accuracy past depth 10 and answered 7.6 times faster.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.960
Use the retrofit when you need deeper latent reasoning without increasing inference cost.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:36.820
Avoid it if the task requires learning entirely new inverse operations that interfere with the

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:44.300
installed mechanism. Test GROC 4.6's 500,000 token context. On a multi-hour agent workflow,

